m It is very important that one is both physically and mentally fit.<br>
m Exercising plays a vital role in our lives.<br>
m It helps us in staying physically fit.<br>
m Out human body is designed to move.<br>
m If we don't walk or exercise daily then we might easily<br>
m get prone to different diseases overtime.<br>
m Just like eating food, going to work daily are some of the<br>
